---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — MSRTC ST Bus Info';
const description = 'Privacy Policy for MSRTC ST Bus Info: how this site uses cookies, Google Analytics, Google AdSense advertisements and server log files.';
const path = '/privacy';
---

<Base title={title} description={description} path={path}>

  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem;max-width:800px;">
    <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size:2.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="guide-content-article" style="line-height:1.75;font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink);">
      <p>Last updated: November 2026</p>

      <p>
        At <strong>MSRTC ST Bus Info</strong> (accessible from <a href="https://msrtc.shivrajsinh.in">msrtc.shivrajsinh.in</a>), one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document describes the types of information collected and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Independent Public Directory Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        MSRTC ST Bus Info is an independent informational utility compiled from published public transport records. We are not owned, operated, or endorsed by Maharashtra State Road Transport Corporation (MSRTC).
      </p>

      <h2>2. Google AdSense &amp; Advertising Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Google is a third-party vendor on our site. It uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to our site and other sites on the internet. Visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors find and use this site, such as pages viewed, approximate location, device type and links clicked. Google Analytics uses cookies and processes this data on our behalf. You can read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">how Google uses this data</a> or opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Log Files</h2>
      <p>
        MSRTC ST Bus Info follows standard log file procedures. These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to reach out to us at <code>privacy@shivrajsinh.in</code>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

</Base>
